PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_Intro::
    .string "I am BLUE of the ELITE FOUR!\p"
    .string "...Wow. That sounded way too\\n"
    .string "formal.\p"
    .string "SURPRISE! I'M IN THE ELITE FOUR!\p"
    .string "Strong TRAINERS come here with\\n"
    .string "awesome POKéMON, and I get to\l"
    .string "battle them all the time!\p"
    .string "Champion? Nah. This is perfect.$"

PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_IntroWater::
    .string "DITTO taught me how to handle\\n"
    .string "basically anything.\p"
    .string "So bring something weird.$"

PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_IntroFire::
    .string "Remember that EEVEE back on\\n"
    .string "ROUTE 22?\p"
    .string "Look at FLAREON now. Actually...\\n"
    .string "look at ALL of us now.$"

PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_IntroElectric::
    .string "Remember that tiny PICHU?\\n"
    .string "Look at RAICHU now!\p"
    .string "...You are about to get hit with\\n"
    .string "SO MUCH LIGHTNING.$"

PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_IntroChallenge::
    .string "{PLAYER}. We've been battling\\n"
    .string "since we were kids...\p"
    .string "Your best against our best.\p"
    .string "LET'S. GOOOOOO!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Knew you'd be back.\p"
    .string "Champion or not, you still have\\n"
    .string "to get through me.\p"
    .string "And I've gotten stronger since\\n"
    .string "last time. Let's go!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_Defeat::
    .string "YES!\\n"
    .string "That was AWESOME!$"

PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_RematchDefeat::
    .string "Ha! Still got it, huh?$"

PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "Look how strong you got.\\n"
    .string "Look how strong WE got.\p"
    .string "ROUTE 22 feels like forever ago.\p"
    .string "You guys were incredible.\\n"
    .string "Seriously.\p"
    .string "Couldn't ask for a better team.\\n"
    .string "I think that was our best battle\l"
    .string "ever.\p"
    .string "And somehow... you're still not\\n"
    .string "done.\p"
    .string "The Champion is—\p"
    .string "...\p"
    .string "Nope. I was specifically told not\\n"
    .string "to ruin this.\p"
    .string "Apparently I 'cannot keep a secret\\n"
    .string "when I'm excited.'\p"
    .string "Which is... probably fair.\p"
    .string "Go get 'em, {PLAYER}.$"

PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_RematchPostBattle::
    .string "Fine. Go see who's waiting for\\n"
    .string "you.$"
